{"id": "EUVD-2026-102291", "enisaUuid": "f6f1a9f6-e632-32fc-ad75-3cb888409344", "description": "UADE through 3.05 contains an out-of-bounds read vulnerability in uade_filemagic() in amifilemagic.c caused by unsigned bufsize subtraction wrapping on short inputs. Attackers can supply a crafted short module that passes format probe bounds checks and reads far past the buffer, crashing applications that probe or play it.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T18:57:51", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T18:57:51", "baseScore": 6.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind-pwn/uade-amifilemagic-bufsize-underflow-oob-read", "https://gitlab.com/uade-music-player/uade/-/blob/659d2fb2dda66bb16ae43b46147135759f993d8e/src/frontends/common/amifilemagic.c#L1069-1078", "https://gitlab.com/uade-music-player/uade", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/uade-through-3.05-out-of-bounds-read-in-uade-filemagic-via-short-module"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111164", "GHSA-p7qf-988j-mfvc"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ef2d0d45-d05c-36d4-9c98-45c9266064ba", "product": {"name": "uade", "vendor": {"name": "UADE"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.05"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ad228f21-ac48-3479-9448-efc64ff7478c", "vendor": {"name": "UADE"}}], "isExploited": false}